{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"agent_message","text":"The schema cycle argument checks out: `schema` already depends on `query`, while `query` depends on `index`; moving card-one/schema interpretation into `query` by requiring `schema` would create a direct `query ↔ schema` cycle. The eager schema dispatch preserves separate `:as-of` and `:schema-as-of` reads. The remaining concern is the compatibility scaffolding around that correct change, not the eager interpretation itself."}}
